  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1137478,
    "UIName": "Talon",
    "Id": "chassisdef_talon_TLN-5VNO",
    "Name": "Talon",
    "Details": "The 5VNO is a downgraded Succession Wars era version using a standard 210 engine, reducing its ground speed down to a maximum of 90 km/h with seven and a half tons of standard armor. It has a single PPC in the right arm for ranged combat, backed up pair of medium lasers in the left arm. This design has no lower arm actuators allowing it to flip its weapons into the rear arc. A few units have  been reported fielded by pirates.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
